WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:18,770
Rectal cancer, second colonoscopy showed seven polyps that were removed during the colonoscopy.

00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:25,370
I suspect the colon in the tumor had increased in size. I am, however, feeling better with more

00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:34,090
energy. There were no tests to check my metastasis. I am scheduled for an annual visit, but what test should

00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:44,690
I ask? So the test to check from a metastasis, the best test would be a pet scare. So I don't know why they didn't

00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:51,330
recommend that. Many times understand they don't recommend a scan because you're sure it's

00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:58,130
just a paper or some silly thing like that. So that's what I would ask for as a pet scare.

